00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.430
Another useful tool is
the page layout tool.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.900
And if we go up to the page
layout, there are a range of

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.520
features that we can utilise here.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:21.840
So one of the things there is, if I
decided to go to print this document at

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:30.015
the moment and selected print, as you can
see that is showing on more than one page.

00:00:30.585 --> 00:00:33.285
So if I wanted to print it, it
would automatically print on two

00:00:33.285 --> 00:00:34.935
page, which wouldn't be appropriate.

00:00:35.504 --> 00:00:37.754
You would then have to put
the two pages together.

00:00:38.325 --> 00:00:41.565
I can change the orientation to landscape.

00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:46.755
And as you can see, this would still
be displayed on two pages because if

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:51.285
you can see this dotted line going down
between column J and K, that is pretty

00:00:51.285 --> 00:00:52.905
much means that that is the page break.

00:00:53.295 --> 00:00:58.995
Now you can see the page break, if you go
down to the bottom right-hand corner and

00:00:58.995 --> 00:01:03.015
you look at the three options there: page
break, preview page layout, and normal.

00:01:03.225 --> 00:01:08.054
So if I go to page break, you can see
that that is where the page break will be.

00:01:08.054 --> 00:01:13.365
So page two will be there, but I can
actually move the page break along.

00:01:13.455 --> 00:01:15.375
So that would all be on page one.

00:01:15.405 --> 00:01:19.065
Now that will resize that to make
sure that it'll all fit on one page.

00:01:19.335 --> 00:01:26.610
So if I go back to normal view and then
go to print, as you can see, all of

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:31.380
the information is now visible on one
page, which is suitable for printing.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:35.970
You always want to make sure that you
don't break data up on multiple pages.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.030
So even if you have an awful lot of
information, you can still reduce the

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:46.440
