by going to the custom scaling option.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:52.515
And if I went to custom scaling and I
selected fit all columns on one page,

00:01:52.815 --> 00:01:56.294
that would shrink the information down
so that everything would fit on a page.

00:01:56.354 --> 00:01:58.845
It will reduce the size,
obviously things will get smaller.

00:01:59.205 --> 00:02:03.945
If I had, for example, 30 or 40
columns to be shown and selected fit

00:02:03.945 --> 00:02:07.125
all columns on one page, obviously it
would have to resize them and reduce

00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:08.924
the size to ensure that they all fit.

